# {{lb|en|transitive}} To have (something) as a primary focus.
#: {{uxi|en|What '''is''' this book '''about'''?}}

====Usage notes====
* Not to be confused with {{m|en|be about to}}, which describes the intention, e.g. "I am about to sell my car".

